{"code":"YL22","wikidata":"Q119009751","wikipedia":{"en":"Thipphawan MRT station","th":"สถานีทิพวัล"},"summary":{"en":"Thipphawan station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Thepharak road in Samut Prakan Province and is named after the Thipphawan Housing Community located adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีทิพวัล เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนเทพารักษ์ในพื้นที่อำเภอเมืองสมุทรปราการ จังหวัดสมุทรปราการ"},"opened":"2023-06-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Thipphawan_Station_01.jpg/960px-Thipphawan_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thipphawan_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Thipphawan_Station_02.jpg/960px-Thipphawan_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thipphawan_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Thipphawan_Station_03.jpg/960px-Thipphawan_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thipphawan_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Thipphawan_Station_04.jpg/960px-Thipphawan_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Thipphawan_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Thipphawan_Station_05.jpg/960px-Thipphawan_Station_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimed